{"seq":3,"slug":"async-observability","title":"异步系统可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/async-observability","wordCount":685,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步系统可观测性\">异步系统可观测性</h1><p>同步调用的失败是即时可见的——调用方立刻收到错误响应。异步消息系统中，失败可能在消息入队几分钟甚至几小时后才发生，且生产者完全不知晓。<strong>可观测性（Observability）</strong> 是对抗这一不可见性的系统性工程：通过日志、指标和追踪三个支柱，让异步消息链路从&quot;黑盒&quot;变为&quot;透明管道&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端到端延迟（E2E Latency）</td>\n<td>从消息发布到被消费者处理完成的完整时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace Context 传播</td>\n<td>将分布式追踪的 Trace ID 随消息 Header 传递，串联消息链路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者 Lag</td>\n<td>积压的消息数量，是消费能力的核心健康指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PEL（Pending Entry List）</td>\n<td>Redis Streams 中已分发但未确认的消息列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息流水线</td>\n<td>从生产到消费的完整处理链路，含重试和 DLQ 节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性三支柱在异步系统中的挑战\">可观测性三支柱在异步系统中的挑战</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支柱</th>\n<th>同步系统</th>\n<th>异步系统挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>日志</strong></td>\n<td>请求链路连续</td>\n<td>消息生命周期跨多个服务和时间点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>指标</strong></td>\n<td>请求成功率直接可见</td>\n<td>消费延迟、DLQ 积压需特别关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>追踪</strong></td>\n<td>Trace ID 随 HTTP Header 传播</td>\n<td>Trace 上下文需随消息 Header 传播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分布式追踪与消息传播\">分布式追踪与消息传播</h2><p>在异步系统中，Trace 上下文必须随消息一起传播，才能将跨服务的消息链路关联成完整的调用树：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    API[API 服务\\nTraceID: abc123] --&gt;|发布消息\\nHeader: traceparent=abc123| K[Kafka]&#10;    K --&gt;|消费消息\\n读取 traceparent| PAY[支付服务\\nSpan: abc123/payment]&#10;    PAY --&gt;|发布结果\\nHeader: traceparent=abc123| K2[Kafka]&#10;    K2 --&gt;|消费消息| NOTIFY[通知服务\\nSpan: abc123/notify]\">flowchart LR\n    API[API 服务\\nTraceID: abc123] --&gt;|发布消息\\nHeader: traceparent=abc123| K[Kafka]\n    K --&gt;|消费消息\\n读取 traceparent| PAY[支付服务\\nSpan: abc123/payment]\n    PAY --&gt;|发布结果\\nHeader: traceparent=abc123| K2[Kafka]\n    K2 --&gt;|消费消息| NOTIFY[通知服务\\nSpan: abc123/notify]</pre><p><strong>OpenTelemetry 消息追踪（Go）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 生产者：在消息 Header 中注入 Trace 上下文&#10;func publishWithTrace(ctx context.Context, writer *kafka.Writer, msg kafka.Message) error {&#10;    // 创建消息发布 Span&#10;    tracer := otel.Tracer(&quot;message-producer&quot;)&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;kafka.produce&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithSpanKind(trace.SpanKindProducer),&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            semconv.MessagingSystemKafka,&#10;            semconv.MessagingDestinationName(msg.Topic),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    // 将 Trace 上下文注入消息 Header&#10;    propagator := otel.GetTextMapPropagator()&#10;    carrier := &amp;KafkaHeaderCarrier{headers: &amp;msg.Headers}&#10;    propagator.Inject(ctx, carrier)&#10;&#10;    return writer.WriteMessages(ctx, msg)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 消费者：从消息 Header 提取 Trace 上下文&#10;func consumeWithTrace(ctx context.Context, msg kafka.Message) {&#10;    propagator := otel.GetTextMapPropagator()&#10;    carrier := &amp;KafkaHeaderCarrier{headers: &amp;msg.Headers}&#10;    ctx = propagator.Extract(ctx, carrier)&#10;&#10;    tracer := otel.Tracer(&quot;message-consumer&quot;)&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;kafka.consume&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithSpanKind(trace.SpanKindConsumer),&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            semconv.MessagingSystemKafka,&#10;            semconv.MessagingKafkaConsumerGroup(&quot;payment-service&quot;),&#10;            semconv.MessagingKafkaMessageOffset(int(msg.Offset)),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    processMessage(ctx, msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产者：在消息 Header 中注入 Trace 上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> publishWithTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">writer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Writer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 创建消息发布 Span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"message-producer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kafka.produce\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithSpanKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trace.SpanKindProducer),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.MessagingSystemKafka,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MessagingDestinationName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Topic),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 将 Trace 上下文注入消息 Header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    propagator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetTextMapPropagator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carrier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KafkaHeaderCarrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{headers: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg.Headers}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    propagator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, carrier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> writer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费者：从消息 Header 提取 Trace 上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> consumeWithTrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    propagator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetTextMapPropagator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carrier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KafkaHeaderCarrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{headers: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg.Headers}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> propagator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Extract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, carrier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"message-consumer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kafka.consume\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithSpanKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trace.SpanKindConsumer),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.MessagingSystemKafka,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MessagingKafkaConsumerGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MessagingKafkaMessageOffset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Offset)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    processMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键消息指标\">关键消息指标</h2><p><strong>Prometheus 指标定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var (&#10;    // 消息处理延迟（从发布到处理的端到端时间）&#10;    messageLatency = prometheus.NewHistogramVec(&#10;        prometheus.HistogramOpts{&#10;            Name:    &quot;message_e2e_latency_seconds&quot;,&#10;            Buckets: []float64{0.01, 0.1, 0.5, 1, 5, 30},&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;topic&quot;, &quot;consumer_group&quot;},&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    // 消息处理结果计数&#10;    messageProcessed = prometheus.NewCounterVec(&#10;        prometheus.CounterOpts{&#10;            Name: &quot;message_processed_total&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;topic&quot;, &quot;status&quot;}, // status: success/failure/dlq&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    // 消费者 Lag（从外部 exporter 获取）&#10;    consumerLag = prometheus.NewGaugeVec(&#10;        prometheus.GaugeOpts{&#10;            Name: &quot;kafka_consumer_group_lag&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;topic&quot;, &quot;partition&quot;, &quot;consumer_group&quot;},&#10;    )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 消息处理延迟（从发布到处理的端到端时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messageLatency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prometheus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewHistogramVec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HistogramOpts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Name:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"message_e2e_latency_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Buckets: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8